    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "id": 13213,
      "0": "A suffocating chill radiates from the pitted iron, as if the metal itself hungers for life. To swing this mace is to invite a creeping shadow that saps the spirit and drains the very will to fight. It is a grim relic of the Lower Caverns, stained by the despair of the dying."
    }
  },
  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Pitted iron meets a handle wrapped in cracked, blackened leather. This blunt instrument bears the deep scars of countless strikes against stone and bone alike."
